    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7fc58535625ca52422b8ca8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家都不再看着真弓了，\n不论是博客、记者采访还是观众席都一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b19b72843e998e91b8b0c4ee97b710c065b06cf4f6e59aeaea19b67de80d69a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
