    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4e4629f1019dacd69444c68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（偶尔难免会有这种状况……？不──）",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d19c65318e9c3244fb8d545e2f6828626b529125aa92866937f96320544dad4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:512fc08457490ccdc51d891e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正常来说应该不会这样的。\n……但惯例终究只是惯例，\n记者并没有义务非得采访我们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "818d06bf84fb467234a90372e9c45d12d28100862c6f84c9c1b1e0dde1c393e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b2a537be6aa56a14da30e2c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──任凭我们想破头也找不到答案。\n还是先转换心情振作精神吧。\n我转过头想勉励身边的她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f09b55fffc95750210276fbd1e0c01ccf6b063459512d8f39b945ba9eca2ecd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5fd940b207c080edb8f1f54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──却不见人影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8efcef7eb6f1edc7d6f58fb173c06a0c006f90d61f49bb7b0dda71481ffedcb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:405689a9d40abd37cee207ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我急忙转头看向另一边，\n却只看到一位陌生的青年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcb46296ca412fb2ca1be5e315b5986c6f1373ff804fea4646e5dc3f9e3e28c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6691a25a60c901bd59a5a10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我用目光巡视着\n对面座位、车门前与隔壁车厢，\n但眼神所到之处皆是陌生的面孔──",
      "source_fingerprint": "76d7aed1f64180e633a57f0524b54ba9f3c9ea871ae29d2cc0c6947b39da9ee2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f9dab5a1115d697aeaa2bfb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……真弓？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d779be644893984d38a7af9e453f54ccef327944cf0828be66c8beae828dcbf0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec5d08767b8ffda22b58583a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "偏偏只有她消失了踪迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ec04e4cc8605b0d5c7fbfea426f4d1581895d448f310ac07769474b44b2154",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
